{
  "file_id": "3558",
  "format": "etdf",
  "kind": "ETDF",
  "text_count": 58,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "Why'd you do that? You used up all\nof our subway fare!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6056,
      "_bytes": 54,
      "translation": "¿Por qué? ¡Os habéis gastado\ntoda la pasta del metro!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "We couldn't help it, we really\nwanted some hamburgers...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6111,
      "_bytes": 56,
      "translation": "No pudimos evitarlo, de verdad\nqueríamos hamburguesas..."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Sorry! We couldn't resist the\ntemptation.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6168,
      "_bytes": 41,
      "translation": "¡Perdón! No pudimos resistir\nla tentación."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "It's all because we slept past our\nstop...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6210,
      "_bytes": 42,
      "translation": "Nos dormimos y nos pasamos\nde parada..."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Why didn't any of you wake us up?",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6253,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "¿Por qué no nos despertó nadie?"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Well, you know...",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6287,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "Pues ya sabes..."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "You told us not to talk in front\nof the people on the train!",
      "speaker_id": 2721,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6305,
      "_bytes": 60,
      "translation": "¡Nos dijiste que no habláramos\ndelante de la gente del tren!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "So what are we supposed to do now?",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6366,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "¿Y ahora qué hacemos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Heh heh! Leave it to me! I've\nthought real hard about this!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6401,
      "_bytes": 59,
      "translation": "¡Jeje! ¡Dejádmelo a mí! ¡Lo he\npensado muy bien!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Really?!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6461,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "¡¿Seguro?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Yeah! We'll hitchhike!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6470,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "¡Sí! ¡Haremos autoestop!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "H-hitchhike?!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6493,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡¿A-autoestop?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Heeeeey! Someone give us a ride!\nHey, heeeeeeeeey!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6507,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "¡Eooo! ¡Que alguien nos lleve!\n¡Eh, eooooooo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Hey, heeeeey!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6558,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡Eh, eooooo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "It'll take Tai three days to\nget picked up.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6572,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "A Tai le va a costar tres días\nque le recojan."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Then why don't *you* try?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6619,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¿Y por qué no pruebas tú?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Huh?! Us?",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6645,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¿Nosotros?"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Y...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6655,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "Y..."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Yaaaaaaaay...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6660,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "Bieeeen..."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Hahaha! At that rate it'll take\nover a week! No, more like a\nmonth!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6674,
      "_bytes": 67,
      "translation": "¡Jajaja! ¡A ese paso tardaréis\nmás de una semana! ¡No, más\nbien un mes!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "All right, then, I'll try.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6742,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "Vale, pues lo intento yo."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6769,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6773,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "They left. Why'd you say no?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6777,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "Se fue. ¿Por qué le dijiste\nque no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Well, because...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6806,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "Bueno, porque..."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "It was because of the pretty lady\ndriving the car, right?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6823,
      "_bytes": 57,
      "translation": "Era por la chica guapa que\nconducía el coche, ¿verdad?"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "N-no! We wouldn't all fit in that\ncar...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6881,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "¡N-no! No cabríamos todos en\nese coche..."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Matt, your face is all red!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6922,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "Matt, ¡tienes la cara roja!"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Shut up!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6952,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "¡Cállate!"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Mimi and I can try!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6961,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Mimi y yo probamos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "All right!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6981,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Muy bien!"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Take us to Odaiba!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 6992,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¡Llévanos a Odaiba!"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Take us to Odaiba!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7011,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¡Llévanos a Odaiba!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "It'll work this time.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7030,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "Esta vez funcionará."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Girls really are better at this\nkind of thing...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7052,
      "_bytes": 48,
      "translation": "Vosotras, las chicas, sabéis\nmás de estas cosas..."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Is that how it works, Tai?",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7101,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "¿Así funciona esto, Tai?"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Well, yeah.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7131,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "Pues sí."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "It stopped!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7143,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Ha parado!"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "We did it! Looks like it's okay!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7155,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "¡Lo logramos! ¡Parece que va bien!"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "So that's how it works!",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7188,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¡Así que es así la cosa!"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Whoa! W-wait...He left.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7212,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¡Vaya! Espera... Se fue."
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "But he said he'd give us a ride...\nWhy'd he leave all of a sudden?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7236,
      "_bytes": 66,
      "translation": "Pero dijo que nos llevaría...\n¿Por qué se ha ido de repente?"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Tai!",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7303,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡Tai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaah! It's a squid monster!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7311,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "¡Aaaaaaaah! ¡Un monstruo calamar!"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "That's Gesomon!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7345,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Es Gesomon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "The driver was trying to get away\nfrom him!",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7361,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "¡El conductor intentaba escapar\nde él!"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Let's go, guys!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7405,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Vamos, chicos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Tai! Gesomon isn't that way!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7421,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¡Tai! ¡Gesomon no está por ahí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Sorry, sorry! I'll head over right\nnow!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7453,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "¡Perdón! ¡Voy para allá\nahora mismo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "GSHAAAAAAAAAAH!!",
      "speaker_id": 4909,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7493,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¡¡GSHAAAAAAAAAH!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "He's coming!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7510,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¡Ya viene!"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "We somehow managed to defeat him,\nbut...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7523,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "Conseguimos derrotarlo,\npero..."
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "...now everyone's in a panic.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7564,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "...ahora cunde el pánico."
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Can't blame them... well, things\nwill work out somehow!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7594,
      "_bytes": 55,
      "translation": "¡No se les puede culpar...\nbueno, todo se arreglará!"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "The fact Digimon can appear from\neven a river like this means that\nwe must be careful in the future.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7650,
      "_bytes": 100,
      "translation": "Que un Digimon pueda aparecer\nincluso en un río así significa\nque debemos tener cuidado."
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "The river... That's it! If we ride\non Ikkakumon, we can all get back\nto Odaiba!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7751,
      "_bytes": 79,
      "translation": "El río... ¡Eso es! ¡Si montamos\nen Ikkakumon, podemos volver\ntodos a Odaiba!"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Everyone's making a fuss anyway,\nI guess it doesn't matter if they\nreact to Gesomon or Ikkakumon.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7831,
      "_bytes": 97,
      "translation": "Total, todos están alterados\nigual, no creo que importe si\nes Gesomon o Ikkakumon."
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "All right, let's head back to\nOdaiba!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 7929,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "¡Muy bien, volvamos ya\na Odaiba!"
    }
  ]
}